SPM12 Derivative - NeuroLingua Dataset
===============================

Overview

This folder contains derived files produced using SPM12 from raw functional MRI data in the NeuroLingua dataset. The derivatives include motion parameters, preprocessed functional images, and statistical models (STAT) for individual participants.

Dataset Structure
-----------------
PartialConjunctionAnalysis/
Contains group-level statistical maps, including percentile- and FDR-thresholded atlases for auditory and visual contrasts.

sub-xxxx/func/
Participant-level files:

s6dwuasub-xxxx_*.nii / s8dwuasub-xxxx_*.nii — preprocessed functional images

rp_asub-xxxx_*.txt — motion parameter text files

sub-xxxx/STAT/
Contains SPM STAT model directories corresponding to individual run designs.

Notes
-----
Filenames follow BIDS derivative conventions where possible, but some may retain original SPM-specific naming conventions.

Participants included in this derivative correspond to those present in participants.tsv.

Sources
-------
Derived from the NeuroLingua phenotypic dataset (../../phenotype) and raw functional MRI acquisitions.

Acknowledgements
----------------
Please cite the NeuroLingua dataset and related publications if using this dataset. For details, see `dataset_description.json`.

